WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.537
The second half is about running safely.

2
00:00:02.537 --> 00:00:05.775
The snippets have no Resource
Manager endpoints at all.

3
00:00:05.775 --> 00:00:08.256
Nothing ties a call to
the permission it needs,

4
00:00:08.256 --> 00:00:11.913
though Learn asks for the least
privileged permission for each one.

5
00:00:11.913 --> 00:00:14.579
There's no paging in the Python snippets,

6
00:00:14.579 --> 00:00:19.912
the SDK won't retry throttled items inside
a batch, and there's nothing about beta.

7
00:00:19.912 --> 00:00:24.536
So the verdict: use Learn's page as the
model for the three things that change per

8
00:00:24.536 --> 00:00:28.802
cloud, add the authority, and for
background jobs use the hardened client,

9
00:00:28.802 --> 00:00:33.480
because a reviewer will ask which calls,
with which permissions, in which cloud.
